  <para unique="1091444">
   <string>TESTUI copies the current value of the user interrupt flag (UIF) into EFLAGS.CF. This instruction can be executed regardless of CPL.</string></para>
  <para unique="1091445">
   <string>TESTUI may be executed normally inside a transactional region.</string></para>
  <section level="6">
   <title unique="1091446"><string>Operation</string></title>
   <programlisting><string>CF := UIF;</string><string>
</string><string>ZF := AF := OF := PF := SF := 0;</string><string>
</string></programlisting>
   </section>
